<title>USA: UNUM Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>UNUM Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Maine 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.62		    $0.99</p>
<p> Net			115,000		   72,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,043,000		1,001,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  69,800		   73,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating income excludes realized investment gains/losses and other special items.</p>
<p>Q1 earnings exclude after-tax realized investment losses of $1.3 million and a $37.5 million after-tax special item to recognize gains related to the previously announced sale of UNUM's tax sheltered annuity businesses.</p>
</text>
